37 Write real with field and fraction
38 Store to stack
39 Real equal
40 Real unequal
41 Real less than
42 Real less than or equal
43 Real greater than
44 Real greater or equal
45 Integer equal
46 Integer not equal
47 Integer less than
48 Integer less than or equal
49 Integer greater than
50 Integer greater or equal
51 Boolean 'or'
52 Integer add
53 Integer subtract
54 Real add
55 Real subtract
56 Boolean 'and'
57 Integer multiply
58 Integer divide
59 Integer modulo
60 Real multiply
